  speakerName: 
  storyText: "1. THE FATIGUE TAX\n    Your Hunger and Thirst act as your body's fuel tank. If you let them drop, actions require far more energy."
  narrativeBeats:
  - "\u25CF HEALTHY (50% - 100% Fuel): \n            Actions cost Normal Stamina.\n        \n        \n            \u25CF EXHAUSTED (25% - 49% Fuel): \n            Actions cost 1.5x Stamina.\n        \n        \n            \u25CF STARVING (0% - 24% Fuel): \n            Actions cost 2.0x Stamina!"
  - "2. BURNING THE MUSCLE\n    This world will rarely tell you \"No.\" If an action requires more Stamina than you currently possess, you can still attempt it.\n    \n    \n        CRITICAL OVER-EXERTION:"
  - Pushing past your limits will drain your remaining Stamina to 0 and rip the remaining cost directly from your HEALTH (HP).
